# GMS maxes this at 10 with 6*L% less damage taken. Stretched to 20 levels at
# half the step, ending at the same 60%, which the Bandit's Shield Mastery also
# reaches for half the points. It multiplies with Evasion Boost's dodge instead
# of adding to it.
#
# What it really is, a barrier with a cap on what it absorbs, isn't modelled:
# nothing here tracks damage over time.
name: "Aggressive Resistance"
description:
  "When attacking, creates a barrier that reduces a percentage of incoming "
  "damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SNIPER skill_order: 6 }
max_level: 20
base { damage_taken_pct: 0.03 }
per_level { damage_taken_pct: 0.03 }
